Task 2: Develop Internal Audit Plan, Scope, and Criteria
Create plan/audit_plan.md using nano or vim.

Include these sections (fill in details relevant to a fictitious organization, e.g., "AlNafi FinTech Ltd"):

Audit Objective: e.g., verify ISMS conformity to ISO 27001:2022 and effectiveness
Scope: departments/systems included (e.g., "Cloud Infrastructure Team, HR onboarding process")
Criteria: ISO 27001:2022 clauses 4-10 + selected Annex A controls
Audit Team & Roles: lead auditor, technical auditor, auditee contacts
Schedule: table with dates, sessions, and locations (physical/virtual)
Resources: checklist CSV, interview templates, evidence repository path
Validate the plan file structure:

wc -l plan/audit_plan.md
grep -E "Objective|Scope|Criteria" plan/audit_plan.md
Expected: the grep command returns three matching lines confirming required sections exist.

