Troubleshooting
pandoc PDF fails: install texlive via sudo apt install -y texlive-latex-base or export to .html instead
CSV append script errors: check the file path is relative to script's execution directory
Empty summarize_status output: confirm CSV has a Status column header exactly matching case
Conclusion
In this lab, you performed an end-to-end internal audit of an ISMS against ISO 27001:2022, mirroring CGRC Domain 5 practices. You built an audit working environment, developed a formal audit plan with defined scope and criteria, simulated evidence collection through interviews and technical walkthroughs, logged nonconformities using a Python-driven register, and produced a final audit report with a corrective action plan. These skills directly support the Cybersecurity Auditor role and reinforce practical ISO 27001:2022 internal audit competencies.
